# - PROXY_PORT (replaced by MCP_SERVER_URL)
# - DB_MODE=proxy (replaced by direct MCP server connection)
# - PROXY_BASE_URL (replaced by MCP_SERVER_URL)
# - PROXY_DEFAULT_CONN (no longer needed)
# - PROXY_API_KEY (replaced by MCP_API_KEY)